        "original_id": "45a1f39a-2eb8-5fda-8c56-59861108caec",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Hinterland, Hinterland: Orc Lords\n- Companies: Tilted Mill Entertainment\n- Concepts: high fantasy role-playing video games, city-building elements, orcs\n- People: Manuel Schenkhuizen\n\nFacts:\n- Tilted Mill Entertainment developed Hinterland as a high fantasy role-playing video game with city-building elements.\n- In March 2009, Hinterland: Orc Lords was released to digital distribution and retail as a cumulative expansion for Hinterland.\n- Hinterland: Orc Lords added the ability to play as Orc characters.\n- Orcs, also spelled orks, are fictional humanoid creatures in a fantasy race akin to goblins.\n- Manuel Schenkhuizen, playing as Orc, has won more than 38 LAN tournaments, including six World Championships.",
